OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 22 DEC
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GFrench harpsichordist and
OL,9,     Gconductor Christophe Rousset
OL,10,     Gleads an all-star cast of
OL,11,     Gsoloists, the Monteverdi Choir
OL,12,     Gand the English Baroque Soloists
OL,13,     Gin Handel's oratorio 'Messiah'.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: Winterreisen
OL,15,     GA retired librarian makes a
OL,16,     Gfestive journey with her niece's
OL,17,     Gfamily. New short story by Wendy
OL,18,     GErskine about a winter journey,
OL,19,     Ginspired by Schubert's song
OL,20,     Gcycle. Read by Sian Thomas.
